| Finding | Original Assessment | Updated Assessment | Notes |
|---------|--------------------|--------------------|-------|
| F1: Binary isConstrained | ✅ Done | ✅ Confirmed Done | Split into networkTier + deviceTier |
| F2: No Continuous Scaling | ✅ Done | ✅ Confirmed Done | Full 5-tier with per-function scaling |
| F3: WS Reconnect Ignores Library | ✅ Done | ⚠️ Done with BUG-03, BUG-11 | WS reconnects but tier changes tear down active connections |
| F4: Static Snapshot | ✅ Done | ⚠️ Done with BUG-05, BUG-11 | Reactive but snapshot replacement creates unnecessary GC churn |
| F5: Quote Flush Throttled | ✅ Done | ⚠️ Done with BUG-06 | Stale flush interval for one timer cycle per transition |
| F6: One-Shot Prefetch | ✅ Done | ⚠️ Done with BUG-07 | Tier-aware but `scheduled` flag blocks re-prefetch |
| F7: Hardcoded Hydration Timeout | ✅ Done | ✅ Confirmed Done | [tierHydrationTimeoutMs()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts#509-522) works correctly |
| F8: SW No Chunk Pre-Cache | ✅ Done | ⚠️ Done with BUG-12 | Pre-caches but no offline fallback for uncached assets |
| F9: Flawed Poll Intervals | ✅ Done | ✅ Confirmed Done | All hooks use [tierPollIntervalMs()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/lib/perfHints.ts#442-452) correctly |
| F10: No manualChunks | ✅ Done | ✅ Confirmed Done | admin + charts-vendor + vendor split |
| F11: Prefetch Fires on Mount | ✅ Done | ⚠️ Done with BUG-13 | Deferred on slow tiers but thunders on fast |
| F12: staleTime Infinity + no retry | 🟡 Partial | ✅ Now Done | Tier-aware retry implemented correctly |

